<title>CHINA: Dazhong Taxi 96 net up 10.87pc.</title>
<headline>Dazhong Taxi 96 net up 10.87pc.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996 (in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1995 figures)  Turnover	 601.748	 vs	415.998</p>
<p> Net profit     111.777	 vs	101.817</p>
<p> Asset per share     4.59 yuan vs	3.89 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share  0.53 yuan vs	0.62 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Dazhong Taxi Co Ltd  </p>
<p>Note: the results were released by a company statement on Tuesday. The numbers are based on domestic accounting standards. Figures based on international accounting standards were not available.</p>
<p>The company's board of directors proposed 10-for-10 bonus issue, pending approval of a shareholders meeting, the statement said.</p>
</text>
